---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Contact — Get in Touch with AnatomiaX"
description: "Contact AnatomiaX for support, feedback, or partnership inquiries about our 3D anatomy and medical education platform."
---

<section class="border-b border-base-300 bg-base-100 py-14 sm:py-16">
  <div class="container-anatomia">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">Contact</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">We would love to hear from you</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70 sm:text-base">
        Questions about learning, partnership, or reporting a content concern? Reach out — we read
        every message.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-base-200 py-12 sm:py-16">
  <div class="container-anatomia">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Contact details</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">
            Email us at
            <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="link link-primary">{{ site.email }}</a>
            <span class="text-xs text-base-content/50"> — placeholder</span> or use the form. We
            typically respond within 1–2 business days.
          </p>
          <div id="support" class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-base-200 p-4">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium">Support</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/60">
              Having trouble accessing learning paths or 3D? Include your device and browser details
              so we can help faster.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Office</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/60">
            AnatomiaX — Medical education technology<br />
            Remote-first, with global collaborators
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Send a message</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/50">
          Demo form only — no backend connected in this initial setup.
        </p>
        <form class="mt-6 space-y-4" onsubmit="return false;">
          <div class="form-control">
            <label class="label" for="name">
              <span class="label-text">Name</span>
            </label>
            <input id="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name" class="input input-bordered w-full" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-control">
            <label class="label" for="email">
              <span class="label-text">Email</span>
            </label>
            <input id="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" class="input input-bordered w-full" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-control">
            <label class="label" for="message">
              <span class="label-text">Message</span>
            </label>
            <textarea
              id="message"
              class="textarea textarea-bordered h-24"
              placeholder="How can we help?"
            ></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary w-full">Send Message</button>
          <p class="text-xs text-base-content/50">
            By contacting us you agree to our <a href="/safety/" class="link">Safety</a> notice.
          </p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
